              VUDA Approved
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-8 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
                <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-charcoal">Port City</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6">A 182-acre layout of about 790 plots at Thagarapuvalasa on NH-16, north of Visakhapatnam. Open plots with marked boundaries, compound wall, utility lines, parks and wide access roads.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-t border-surface-container-high pt-6 mt-4">
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div>
                  <span class="block font-label-caps text-label-caps text-outline mb-1 uppercase tracking-widest">Location</span>
                  <span class="font-body-md text-body-md text-charcoal">Thagarapuvalasa, Visakhapatnam</span>
                </div>
                <div>
