          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-4xl mb-4">mail</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-charcoal mb-4">Be the First to Know</h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6">Leave your email for early details when we launch a new layout.</p>
          <button class="mt-8 w-full border border-outline-variant/30 py-3 font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-widest text-charcoal hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">Join Mailing List</button>
